# Meta Model API key for the live ServeDoctor demo (`python3 -m servedoctor demo`)
# and the Spark/Wonder evaluation arms. Copy this file to .env, put your key after
# the equals sign, then load it into your shell:   set -a; . ./.env; set +a
# Nothing reads .env automatically, and .env is git-ignored: never commit a real key.
MODEL_API_KEY=
# META_API_KEY is also accepted instead of MODEL_API_KEY.
# Optional: Muse Wonder model ID for `--model wonder` (default muse-wonder-1.0).
# META_WONDER_MODEL=muse-wonder-1.0
